  "executive_briefing": "As of late June 2026, the crypto-financial ecosystem is undergoing a structural transformation characterized by the maturation of Bitcoin as a primary institutional treasury asset. The progress of the Digital Asset Market Clarity Act (H.R. 3633) is now a central focus, as it nears Senate consideration with the potential to define jurisdictional lines and enable 'programmable' Bitcoin environments. Simultaneously, Ethereum continues to be the dominant settlement layer for DeFi but faces operational scrutiny and funding challenges, prompting a pivot toward intent-based, non-custodial bridging solutions that reduce reliance on vulnerable wrapped-token models for BTC-EVM interoperability.",
